{"id":"n17987-1-7","stage":1,"title":"고속버스 · 高速大巴","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17987-1-7-1","ko":"속초 가려면 뭐 타고 가는 게 제일 좋을까?","zh":"去束草的话，坐什么交通工具最好呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"속초","meaning":"束草","explanation":"속초：束草","readings":[{"term":"속초","audio":"/audio/db53dc6c72837be2a7cf.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"가려면","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"타고","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去，开往，飞向","explanation":"가다：去，开往，飞向；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋을까?","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上；去，开往，飞向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"c181b2319e3ac556","term":"제일","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3","entryId":"92032","definition":"在多个对象中首屈一指地。","pronunciation":["제ː일"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/2746454f89a27321036d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17987-1-7-2","ko":"고속버스로 가는 게 그래도 제일 빠를걸.","zh":"坐高速巴士应该还是最快的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고속버스로","meaning":"高速大巴，高速巴士","explanation":"고속버스：高速大巴，高速巴士；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"고속버스","audio":"/audio/49d339b4b52bcdc46e2f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17987","senseId":"1","lemma":"고속버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가는","meaning":"去，开往，飞向","explanation":"가다：去，开往，飞向；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"2","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래도","meaning":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","explanation":"그래도：“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빠를걸.","meaning":"快，快速","explanation":"빠르다：快，快速；ㄹ걸：表示推测，或对没有做某事表示遗憾；由完整句子判断。","readings":[{"term":"빠르다","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68755","senseId":"2","lemma":"빠르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"49d339b4b52bcdc4","term":"고속버스","zh":"高速大巴，高速巴士","audio":"/audio/49d339b4b52bcdc46e2f.mp3","entryId":"17987","definition":"主要走高速公路、时速很快跑长途的巴士。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，开往，飞向","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"船、飞机、汽车等去往某个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"82bd547e58bb6509","term":"그래도","zh":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3","entryId":"36264","definition":"“그리하여도(即便如此)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"c181b2319e3ac556","term":"제일","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3","entryId":"92032","definition":"在多个对象中首屈一指地。","pronunciation":["제ː일"]},{"id":"904de91feaff572f","term":"빠르다","zh":"快，快速","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3","entryId":"68755","definition":"从一处移动到其它地方所用的时间短。","pronunciation":["빠르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8b0cc13de8bec7325459.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.68,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17987","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"